  "details": "Some of us would love if VRchat had the option for hand based headlook/orientation. An option for decoupled head look. Right now it is \"look where you go\" by default for motion sickness purposes and it makes sense. But sme of us would love to see an option to be able to look all around the world while traversing forward (like Onward does it with the hands acting as free hip tracking in a way) This will allow to to take in the environments easier.",
